<title>USA: Continental Gulfstream reaches agreement.</title>
<headline>Continental Gulfstream reaches agreement.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines said on Wednesday that it entered into an agreement with Gulfstream International Airlines Inc regarding flights connecting to Florida and the Bahamas.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, Continental would handle all reservations for Gulfstream International and all flights will appear as Continental flight numbers, effective April 1997.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
